{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"91612e40419f1e2a60a85905","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k%40t-online.de/","channels":["openembedded-core"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k@t-online.de","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k%40t-online.de/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k@t-online.de"},"subject":"Re: [oe-core][PATCH 2/2] clang: auto-derive CLANG_EXTRA_OE_DISTRO from DISTRO","messages":{"CAMKF1srji-Cwc7_Q7zr6rjDSL8p3sSEXTfXh4zoiOkK6Dg=AZA@mail.gmail.com":{"id":"CAMKF1srji-Cwc7_Q7zr6rjDSL8p3sSEXTfXh4zoiOkK6Dg=AZA@mail.gmail.com","messageId":"CAMKF1srji-Cwc7_Q7zr6rjDSL8p3sSEXTfXh4zoiOkK6Dg=AZA@mail.gmail.com","references":["20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k@t-online.de","20260812161341.822689-2-f_l_k@t-online.de","CAMKF1spJ66aBORv02hW-gGRm4X1q0mBG1q4V6eHMhCWGOXmE_Q@mail.gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["CAMKF1spJ66aBORv02hW-gGRm4X1q0mBG1q4V6eHMhCWGOXmE_Q@mail.gmail.com","20260812161341.822689-2-f_l_k@t-online.de","20260812161341.822689-1-f_l_k@t-online.de"],"author":{"name":"Khem Raj","address":"raj.khem@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"","address":"f_l_k@t-online.de"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org"},{"name":"Claude","address":"noreply@anthropic.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-14T07:12:57.000Z","iso":"2026-08-14T07:12:57.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [oe-core][PATCH 2/2] clang: auto-derive CLANG_EXTRA_OE_DISTRO from DISTRO","mailingLists":[{"id":"openembedded-core.lists.openembedded.org","displayName":"openembedded-core.lists.openembedded.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"On Thu, Aug 13, 2026 at 6:02 PM Khem Raj <raj.khem@gmail.com> wrote:"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"I am seeing a libcxx-native failure on debian13/arm64 host building for"},{"depth":1,"text":"'yoe' distro. See"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"https://errors.yoctoproject.org/Errors/Details/962419/"},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":5,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"FWIW, this patch is not cause of the above error. So this one is fine."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"On Wed, Aug 12, 2026 at 9:13 AM Markus Volk via lists.openembedded.org"},{"depth":1,"text":"<f_l_k=t-online.de@lists.openembedded.org> wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"CLANG_EXTRA_OE_VENDORS already auto-derives from TARGET_VENDOR and"},{"depth":2,"text":"SDK_VENDOR, recognizing a self-hosted OE build host without manual"},{"depth":2,"text":"configuration. CLANG_EXTRA_OE_DISTRO has no equivalent -- it ships"},{"depth":2,"text":"only 'poky:poky', so a self-hosted host running a custom DISTRO must"},{"depth":2,"text":"be manually registered before Distro::IsOpenEmbedded() recognizes it"},{"depth":2,"text":"via /etc/os-release."},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"This is easy to get wrong by hand, since the registered id must"},{"depth":2,"text":"exactly match the raw ID= value in /etc/os-release, including any"},{"depth":2,"text":"hyphens, which must NOT be converted to underscores (unlike the"},{"depth":2,"text":"generated C++ enumerator name, which requires the conversion). A"},{"depth":2,"text":"single typo silently disables the OE-specific GCC-install candidate"},{"depth":2,"text":"with no error, causing native clang-toolchain builds to fail to find"},{"depth":2,"text":"crtbeginS.o/libgcc despite running on a genuinely OE-built host."},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"Auto-derive an entry for the current DISTRO the same way"},{"depth":2,"text":"CLANG_EXTRA_OE_VENDORS already does, so self-hosted OE build hosts"},{"depth":2,"text":"are recognized out of the box with no configuration and no"},{"depth":2,"text":"hyphen/underscore typo risk. 'poky' is skipped since it is already"},{"depth":2,"text":"the shipped default."},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"Signed-off-by: Markus Volk <f_l_k@t-online.de>"},{"depth":2,"text":"Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"},{"depth":2,"text":"---"},{"depth":2,"text":" meta/recipes-devtools/clang/llvm-project-source.inc | 1 +"},{"depth":2,"text":" 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"diff --git a/meta/recipes-devtools/clang/llvm-project-source.inc"},{"depth":2,"text":"b/meta/recipes-devtools/clang/llvm-project-source.inc"},{"depth":2,"text":"index 5cd08d4085..5a07080d55 100644"},{"depth":2,"text":"--- a/meta/recipes-devtools/clang/llvm-project-source.inc"},{"depth":2,"text":"+++ b/meta/recipes-devtools/clang/llvm-project-source.inc"},{"depth":2,"text":"@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ CLANG_EXTRA_OE_VENDORS ?= \"${TARGET_VENDOR}"},{"depth":2,"text":"${SDK_VENDOR}\""},{"depth":2,"text":" # \":\" separated the ID in \"/etc/os-release\" and the triple for finding"},{"depth":2,"text":"gcc on this OE DISTRO."},{"depth":2,"text":" # eg: \"poky:poky wrlinux:wrs\""},{"depth":2,"text":" CLANG_EXTRA_OE_DISTRO ?= \"poky:poky\""},{"depth":2,"text":"+CLANG_EXTRA_OE_DISTRO:append = \"${@ ' ' + d.getVar('DISTRO') + ':oe' if"},{"depth":2,"text":"d.getVar('DISTRO') not in ['poky', ''] else ''}\""},{"depth":2,"text":" # Match with MULTILIB_GLOBAL_VARIANTS"},{"depth":2,"text":" ML_VARIANTS = \"lib32 lib64 libx32\""},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"--"},{"depth":2,"text":"2.55.0"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-"},{"depth":2,"text":"Links: You receive all messages sent to this group."},{"depth":2,"text":"View/Reply Online (#243297):"},{"depth":2,"text":"https://lists.openembedded.org/g/openembedded-core/message/243297"},{"depth":2,"text":"Mute This Topic: https://lists.openembedded.org/mt/120720285/1997914"},{"depth":2,"text":"Group Owner: openembedded-core+owner@lists.openembedded.org"},{"depth":2,"text":"Unsubscribe: https://lists.openembedded.org/g/openembedded-core/unsub ["},{"depth":2,"text":"raj.khem@gmail.com]"},{"depth":2,"text":"-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":""}],"lineCount":62,"maximumDepth":2}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"CAMKF1spJ66aBORv02hW-gGRm4X1q0mBG1q4V6eHMhCWGOXmE_Q@mail.gmail.com"}},"rootIds":["CAMKF1srji-Cwc7_Q7zr6rjDSL8p3sSEXTfXh4zoiOkK6Dg=AZA@mail.gmail.com"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["CAMKF1srji-Cwc7_Q7zr6rjDSL8p3sSEXTfXh4zoiOkK6Dg=AZA@mail.gmail.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}